### Hele listen
GET http://localhost:3000/api/patients


### Opret patient
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{"cpr":"0201029994","navn":"Ny Test Person"}


### Uden body - skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Hent symptomregistreringer
GET http://localhost:3000/api/symptomregistreringer


### Opret symptomregistrering
POST http://localhost:3000/api/symptomregistreringer
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "patient_id": 1,
    "smertetype": "Hovedpine",
    "beskrivelse": "Testregistrering til D2",
    "smerteniveau": 5,
    "dato": "2026-11-05"
}


### Opret symptomregistrering uden body - skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/symptomregistreringer
Content-Type: application/json